cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ceaToFoam: NASA CEA chamber thermochemistry to OpenFOAM rocket-nozzle cases"
abstract: >-
  ceaToFoam converts a NASA CEA chamber solution into a ready-to-run
  OpenFOAM rhoCentralFoam case for the flow through a conical
  liquid-rocket thrust chamber. The chamber composition is frozen and
  evaluated with one set of thermodynamic and transport data, which both
  sizes the nozzle for a design thrust and defines the thermophysical
  model of the axisymmetric simulation, so that the design point and the
  CFD describe the same gas.
